{
 "source": "6880904b5 (agent/gfx-packs before GX-21): the panel as mountExperimentalGraphics built it, whitespace between tags removed, the pack group cut to [pack]; the map detail defaults set to strength 0.55 and distance 1.60 by the owner on 2026-10-11 (H135)",
 "off": "<details id=\"experimental-settings\" class=\"s2u-disclosure\"><summary>Experimental settings</summary><section class=\"section\"><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-status\">Select Experimental above. Applies globally to maps and player models.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Enable effects — switch off for original A/B</span></label><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-sharpen\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Detail sharpening</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Sharpness</span><input id=\"exp-sharpness\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-sharpness-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare 0 with 1.5 on existing world edges. Flat colours have no detail to sharpen.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-resolution\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Higher-resolution rendering</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Scale</span><input id=\"exp-renderScale\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"6\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"1.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-renderScale-out\">1.50</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">4x requests 16 times the pixels; 6x requests 36 times. Actual size is limited to 4096 pixels per edge. Bilinear downsampling can still miss fine detail at very high scales.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-render-info\">Render scale is applied while Experimental effects are enabled.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-bloom\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Soft bloom - bright areas</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Strength</span><input id=\"exp-bloomStrength\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0.6\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.2\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomStrength-out\">0.20</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Threshold</span><input id=\"exp-bloomThreshold\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.6\" max=\"0.98\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.6\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomThreshold-out\">0.60</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Spread</span><input id=\"exp-bloomRadius\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"2.5\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"2.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomRadius-out\">2.50</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare strength 0 with 0.6 on bright areas. Threshold 0.6 admits more highlights than 0.98; spread changes the glow's width. Sky and pale surfaces can glow too. Pauses during flashbang glow.</p>[pack]<label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-textureBias\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Map texture mip bias</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Mip bias</span><input id=\"exp-mipBias\" type=\"range\" min=\"-2\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"-1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-mipBias-out\">-1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Negative keeps sharper existing mip levels farther away; positive softens. Textures already at full detail cannot become sharper. Strong negative bias may shimmer.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-detailAdjust\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Adjust existing map detail</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Strength</span><input id=\"exp-detailStrength\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.55\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-detailStrength-out\">0.55</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Distance</span><input id=\"exp-detailRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.6\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-detailRange-out\">1.60</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Modern already shows these detail layers on surfaces that have them. This switch adjusts their strength and distance; switching it off restores the original. No new textures or surface detail are added.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-detail-status\">To compare, enable these adjustments and move strength between 0 and 2 on a nearby surface with detail. Distance only changes how far the layers reach.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-characterLight\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Character lighting</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Ambient</span><input id=\"exp-characterAmbient\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.8\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-characterAmbient-out\">0.80</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Directional</span><input id=\"exp-characterDirectional\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1.25\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-characterDirectional-out\">1.25</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Requires a visible character or worn gear; the map will not change. Compare 0 with 2 for each light; 1 uses the map's original lighting. Ambient lifts shaded areas; directional light emphasizes the existing shape.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-grade\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span>Colour adjustment</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Exposure</span><input id=\"exp-exposure\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.08\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-exposure-out\">0.08</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Contrast</span><input id=\"exp-contrast\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.75\" max=\"1.4\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-contrast-out\">1.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Saturation</span><input id=\"exp-saturation\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.6\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"1.04\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-saturation-out\">1.04</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Exposure -1 to +1 darkens to brightens; saturation 0 removes colour. Exposure 0, contrast 1 and saturation 1 are neutral.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-whiteBalance\" type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\"><span>Warmth and tint</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Warmth</span><input id=\"exp-warmth\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-warmth-out\">0.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Tint</span><input id=\"exp-tint\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-tint-out\">0.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Enable this group, then compare -1 with +1. Warmth: cool blue to warm red. Tint: green to magenta. Zero keeps the existing colour.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-toneBalance\" type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\"><span>Shadow / highlight balance</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Shadows</span><input id=\"exp-shadows\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-shadows-out\">0.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Highlights</span><input id=\"exp-highlights\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-highlights-out\">0.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare -1 with +1 in dark or bright areas. Zero is neutral; middle grey and pure black do not change. Cannot recover detail missing from the source.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-bloomTint\" type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\"><span>Bloom colour</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Red</span><input id=\"exp-bloomRed\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomRed-out\">1.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Green</span><input id=\"exp-bloomGreen\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomGreen-out\">1.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Blue</span><input id=\"exp-bloomBlue\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomBlue-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Requires Soft bloom with positive strength and pixels above its threshold. Compare one channel at 0 and 2 on visible glow; 1 is neutral. Pauses during flashbang glow.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-colour-status\">Colour groups are bypassed until Experimental effects are enabled.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-highlightRollOff\" type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\"><span>Highlight roll-off</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Softness</span><input id=\"exp-highlightStrength\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-highlightStrength-out\">0.50</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare 0 with 1 in bright areas. Keeps darker tones unchanged. Cannot restore detail already clipped in the source image.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-hudSampling\" type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\"><span>HUD and reticle sampling experiment</span></label><label class=\"s2u-field\"><span>Sampling</span><select class=\"s2u-select\" id=\"exp-hudMode\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"nearest\" selected=\"\">Nearest neighbour</option><option value=\"bilinear\">Bilinear</option><option value=\"integer\">Integer nearest</option><option value=\"sharpen\">Nearest + sharpening</option></select></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>UI sharpness</span><input id=\"exp-hudSharpness\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-hudSharpness-out\">0.50</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Integer step</span><input id=\"exp-hudSnap\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-hudSnap-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-hud-status\">Enable Experimental effects and this group to use its controls.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-menuSampling\" type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\"><span>Menu sampling experiment</span></label><label class=\"s2u-field\"><span>Sampling</span><select class=\"s2u-select\" id=\"exp-menuMode\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"nearest\" selected=\"\">Nearest neighbour</option><option value=\"bilinear\">Bilinear</option><option value=\"integer\">Integer nearest</option><option value=\"sharpen\">Nearest + sharpening</option></select></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>UI sharpness</span><input id=\"exp-menuSharpness\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-menuSharpness-out\">0.50</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Integer step</span><input id=\"exp-menuSnap\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-menuSnap-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-menu-status\">Enable Experimental effects and this group to use its controls.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Nearest shows crisp pixels; bilinear softens edges. Sharpening affects RGB only: compare 0 with 1 on coloured detail; uniform-colour icons with only alpha edges will not change. Integer step chooses whole multiples that fit inside the existing box. HUD content stays centred; fills, stretched panels and scope masks keep their coverage. Different integer steps can produce the same size.</p><a class=\"s2u-button\" id=\"exp-menu-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/?devmode=\">Open menu preview</a><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">The link carries menu settings to a new tab. Integer nearest fits the entire 640 x 448 menu frame in the window. Existing menu tabs keep their settings; open the link again after changes. Nothing is stored.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Browser adaptation: these effects have no original console counterpart. Switching them off restores the original picture.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Only the optional local pack loads replacement textures. Modern and PS2 keep the original renderer. First use of an effect may pause briefly. Settings reset on reload.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"s2u-button\" id=\"exp-reset\">Reset experiment</button></section></details>",
 "on": "<details id=\"experimental-settings\" class=\"s2u-disclosure\" open=\"\"><summary>Experimental settings</summary><section class=\"section\"><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-status\">Enhanced picture - world and player models. UI sampling is optional below.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Enable effects — switch off for original A/B</span></label><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-sharpen\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Detail sharpening</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Sharpness</span><input id=\"exp-sharpness\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\"><output id=\"exp-sharpness-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare 0 with 1.5 on existing world edges. Flat colours have no detail to sharpen.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-resolution\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Higher-resolution rendering</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Scale</span><input id=\"exp-renderScale\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"6\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"1.5\"><output id=\"exp-renderScale-out\">1.50</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">4x requests 16 times the pixels; 6x requests 36 times. Actual size is limited to 4096 pixels per edge. Bilinear downsampling can still miss fine detail at very high scales.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-render-info\">Actual world image: 450 × 225 (1.50x).</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-bloom\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Soft bloom - bright areas</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Strength</span><input id=\"exp-bloomStrength\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0.6\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.2\"><output id=\"exp-bloomStrength-out\">0.20</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Threshold</span><input id=\"exp-bloomThreshold\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.6\" max=\"0.98\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.6\"><output id=\"exp-bloomThreshold-out\">0.60</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Spread</span><input id=\"exp-bloomRadius\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"2.5\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"2.5\"><output id=\"exp-bloomRadius-out\">2.50</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare strength 0 with 0.6 on bright areas. Threshold 0.6 admits more highlights than 0.98; spread changes the glow's width. Sky and pale surfaces can glow too. Pauses during flashbang glow.</p>[pack]<label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-textureBias\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Map texture mip bias</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Mip bias</span><input id=\"exp-mipBias\" type=\"range\" min=\"-2\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"-1\"><output id=\"exp-mipBias-out\">-1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Negative keeps sharper existing mip levels farther away; positive softens. Textures already at full detail cannot become sharper. Strong negative bias may shimmer.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-detailAdjust\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Adjust existing map detail</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Strength</span><input id=\"exp-detailStrength\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.55\"><output id=\"exp-detailStrength-out\">0.55</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Distance</span><input id=\"exp-detailRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.6\"><output id=\"exp-detailRange-out\">1.60</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Modern already shows these detail layers on surfaces that have them. This switch adjusts their strength and distance; switching it off restores the original. No new textures or surface detail are added.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-detail-status\">To compare, enable these adjustments and move strength between 0 and 2 on a nearby surface with detail. Distance only changes how far the layers reach.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-characterLight\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Character lighting</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Ambient</span><input id=\"exp-characterAmbient\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.8\"><output id=\"exp-characterAmbient-out\">0.80</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Directional</span><input id=\"exp-characterDirectional\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1.25\"><output id=\"exp-characterDirectional-out\">1.25</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Requires a visible character or worn gear; the map will not change. Compare 0 with 2 for each light; 1 uses the map's original lighting. Ambient lifts shaded areas; directional light emphasizes the existing shape.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-grade\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"><span>Colour adjustment</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Exposure</span><input id=\"exp-exposure\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.08\"><output id=\"exp-exposure-out\">0.08</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Contrast</span><input id=\"exp-contrast\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.75\" max=\"1.4\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"1\"><output id=\"exp-contrast-out\">1.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Saturation</span><input id=\"exp-saturation\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1.6\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"1.04\"><output id=\"exp-saturation-out\">1.04</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Exposure -1 to +1 darkens to brightens; saturation 0 removes colour. Exposure 0, contrast 1 and saturation 1 are neutral.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-whiteBalance\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>Warmth and tint</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Warmth</span><input id=\"exp-warmth\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-warmth-out\">0.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Tint</span><input id=\"exp-tint\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-tint-out\">0.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Enable this group, then compare -1 with +1. Warmth: cool blue to warm red. Tint: green to magenta. Zero keeps the existing colour.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-toneBalance\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>Shadow / highlight balance</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Shadows</span><input id=\"exp-shadows\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-shadows-out\">0.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Highlights</span><input id=\"exp-highlights\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-highlights-out\">0.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare -1 with +1 in dark or bright areas. Zero is neutral; middle grey and pure black do not change. Cannot recover detail missing from the source.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-bloomTint\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>Bloom colour</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Red</span><input id=\"exp-bloomRed\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomRed-out\">1.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Green</span><input id=\"exp-bloomGreen\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomGreen-out\">1.00</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Blue</span><input id=\"exp-bloomBlue\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-bloomBlue-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Requires Soft bloom with positive strength and pixels above its threshold. Compare one channel at 0 and 2 on visible glow; 1 is neutral. Pauses during flashbang glow.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-colour-status\">Warmth/tint: off. Shadow/highlight: off. Bloom colour: off.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-highlightRollOff\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>Highlight roll-off</span></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Softness</span><input id=\"exp-highlightStrength\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-highlightStrength-out\">0.50</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Compare 0 with 1 in bright areas. Keeps darker tones unchanged. Cannot restore detail already clipped in the source image.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-hudSampling\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>HUD and reticle sampling experiment</span></label><label class=\"s2u-field\"><span>Sampling</span><select class=\"s2u-select\" id=\"exp-hudMode\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"nearest\" selected=\"\">Nearest neighbour</option><option value=\"bilinear\">Bilinear</option><option value=\"integer\">Integer nearest</option><option value=\"sharpen\">Nearest + sharpening</option></select></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>UI sharpness</span><input id=\"exp-hudSharpness\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-hudSharpness-out\">0.50</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Integer step</span><input id=\"exp-hudSnap\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-hudSnap-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-hud-status\">Enable Experimental effects and this group to use its controls.</p><label class=\"s2u-check\"><input id=\"exp-menuSampling\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>Menu sampling experiment</span></label><label class=\"s2u-field\"><span>Sampling</span><select class=\"s2u-select\" id=\"exp-menuMode\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"nearest\" selected=\"\">Nearest neighbour</option><option value=\"bilinear\">Bilinear</option><option value=\"integer\">Integer nearest</option><option value=\"sharpen\">Nearest + sharpening</option></select></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>UI sharpness</span><input id=\"exp-menuSharpness\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.5\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-menuSharpness-out\">0.50</output></label><label class=\"s2u-range\"><span>Integer step</span><input id=\"exp-menuSnap\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" disabled=\"\"><output id=\"exp-menuSnap-out\">1.00</output></label><p class=\"s2u-field__note\" id=\"exp-menu-status\">Enable Experimental effects and this group to use its controls.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Nearest shows crisp pixels; bilinear softens edges. Sharpening affects RGB only: compare 0 with 1 on coloured detail; uniform-colour icons with only alpha edges will not change. Integer step chooses whole multiples that fit inside the existing box. HUD content stays centred; fills, stretched panels and scope masks keep their coverage. Different integer steps can produce the same size.</p><a class=\"s2u-button\" id=\"exp-menu-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"http://localhost:3000/?devmode=\">Open menu preview</a><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">The link carries menu settings to a new tab. Integer nearest fits the entire 640 x 448 menu frame in the window. Existing menu tabs keep their settings; open the link again after changes. Nothing is stored.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Browser adaptation: these effects have no original console counterpart. Switching them off restores the original picture.</p><p class=\"s2u-field__note\">Only the optional local pack loads replacement textures. Modern and PS2 keep the original renderer. First use of an effect may pause briefly. Settings reset on reload.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"s2u-button\" id=\"exp-reset\">Reset experiment</button></section></details>",
